OL,3,ASenior US soldier arrested by UK
OL,4,Acounter-terror police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior soldier in the US Army has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested by British
OL,8,Fcounter-terrorism police.
OL,10,FThe 41-year-old man was arrested near
OL,11,FGloucester on Tuesday, on suspicion of
OL,12,Foffences under the National Security
OL,13,FAct, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,15,FThe force said the allegations related
OL,16,Fto Russia. The FBI said the arrest
OL,17,Finvolves allegations of espionage.
OL,19,FAs part of the investigation, officers
OL,20,Fare carrying out searches at two
OL,21,Flocations in Gloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
